---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-20" aria-labelledby="brand-name">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] md:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h1
          id="brand-name"
          class="font-display text-6xl leading-none tracking-[0.14em] md:text-7xl"
        >
          UIVIU
        </h1>
        <p
          class="mt-10 max-w-[18rem] border-t border-rule pt-5 font-mono text-[0.7rem] leading-relaxed tracking-[0.22em] text-ink-soft uppercase"
        >
          LIFE · THOUGHTS · CODE
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-[34rem]">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-snug md:text-[1.75rem]">
          A Rigorous Derivation of Something Entirely Useless, Yet Perfectly
          Symmetrical.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-8 border-t border-rule pt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed md:text-xl">
          经过严谨的非严谨推导，最终得到一个没有实际用途，但看起来很对称的结果。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          关于代码、生活、思考，以及一些本来不必想那么多的事情。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-rule pt-10 pb-4" aria-labelledby="recent-posts">
    <h2
      id="recent-posts"
      class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.22em] text-ink-soft uppercase"
    >
      Recent
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">暂无文章。</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
